---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
import TrustBar from '../components/TrustBar.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '../config/site';
---

<MainLayout 
  title="Pre-Trip Travel & Packing Guide for Ethiopia | Abyssinian Tour Operator"
  description="Essential field guidance compiled by native ground experts: visas (e-Visa), currency, health, regional packing lists, cultural etiquette, drone laws, and emergency field dispatch."
  image="/images/home/hero-lalibela.jpg"
>
  <!-- Page Hero (Matching Design Reference Screenshot 2) -->
  <section class="page-hero" style="background-image: url('/images/home/hero-lalibela.jpg');">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="section-label light">NATIVE FIELD ADVISORY</span>
      <h1>PRE-TRIP TRAVEL & PACKING GUIDE</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">
        Essential field guidance compiled by native ground experts to ensure a safe, seamless, and well-prepared journey across Ethiopia’s diverse highlands, deserts, and valleys.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Section: Pre-Trip Guide Content Grid -->
  <section class="section-pad">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="editorial-grid">
        <!-- Main Column: Guide Sections -->
        <div class="guide-main-col">
          <!-- 1. Pre-Trip Checklist -->
          <div class="card-sand guide-block">
            <span class="section-label">PREPARATION FOUNDATIONS</span>
            <h2>1. PRE-TRIP CHECKLIST</h2>
            <div class="checklist-grid">
              <div class="check-card">
                <div class="check-icon">
                  <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><line x1="16" y1="2" x2="16" y2="6"></line><line x1="8" y1="2" x2="8" y2="6"></line><line x1="3" y1="10" x2="21" y2="10"></line></svg>
                </div>
                <h4>Visa & Documents</h4>
                <p>Check passport validity (minimum 6 months beyond travel dates). Secure official tourist e-Visa at <strong>evisa.gov.et</strong>. Print two physical copies for Bole Airport immigration.</p>
              </div>

              <div class="check-card">
                <div class="check-icon">
                  <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2"></path></svg>
                </div>
                <h4>Health & Immunizations</h4>
                <p>Yellow Fever certificate mandatory if transiting from endemic zones. Check routine vaccines. Malaria prophylaxis for lowland areas (Danakil, Omo Valley, Awash).</p>
              </div>

              <div class="check-card">
                <div class="check-icon">
                  <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path></svg>
                </div>
                <h4>Travel Insurance</h4>
                <p>Ensure your policy includes emergency high-altitude medical evacuation, wilderness exploration coverage, and luggage compensation.</p>
              </div>

              <div class="check-card">
                <div class="check-icon">
                  <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M17.8 19.2 16 11l3.5-3.5C21 6 21.5 4 21 3c-1-.5-3 0-4.5 1.5L13 8 4.8 6.2c-.5-.1-.9.1-1.1.5l-.3.5c-.2.5-.1 1 .3 1.3L9 12l-2 3H4l-1 1 3 2 2 3 1-1v-3l3-2 3.5 5.3c.3.4.8.5 1.3.3l.5-.3c.4-.2.6-.6.5-1.1z"></path></svg>
                </div>
                <h4>Flights & Itinerary</h4>
                <p>Verify e-tickets and domestic flight allocations. Our dispatch team coordinates priority baggage and check-in assistance at Bole Domestic Terminal.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Currency & Banking Details -->
          <div class="card-white guide-block">
            <span class="section-label">FINANCIAL GUIDELINES</span>
            <h2>Foreign Exchange & Cash Guidelines</h2>
            <div class="prose">
              <p>
                <strong>US Dollar Requirements:</strong> When traveling to Ethiopia, bring pristine US Dollar cash banknotes issued in <strong>2013 or newer</strong>. Local commercial banks and foreign exchange desks strictly reject bills with tears, stamps, pinholes, or heavy ink markings.
              </p>
              <p>
                <strong>Ethiopian Birr (ETB):</strong> Official currency exchange is available upon arrival at Bole International Airport (Terminal 2) or authorized commercial banks in Addis Ababa. Keep your official exchange receipts.
              </p>
              <p>
                <strong>Credit Cards & ATMs:</strong> Credit card acceptance (Visa/Mastercard) is limited almost exclusively to international chain hotels in Addis Ababa. Outside the capital, Ethiopia is a cash economy; carry sufficient USD cash to convert for tipping, market purchases, and personal items.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- 2. Essential Packing List & Preparation -->
          <div class="card-sand guide-block">
            <span class="section-label">CLIMATE-SPECIFIC GEAR</span>
            <h2>2. ESSENTIAL PACKING LIST & REGIONAL GEAR</h2>
            <p class="guide-lead">
              Ethiopia features vastly different climate zones—from near-freezing temperatures on 4,000m Simien escarpments to intense desert heat in Danakil. Pack in layers using soft, durable duffel bags (preferred for 4x4 storage).
            </p>

            <div class="packing-accordion">
              <!-- A. Historic North & Simien Trekking -->
              <div class="pack-region-box">
                <div class="pack-region-header">
                  <h3>A. Historic North & Simien Trekking (Highland Cold & Sun)</h3>
                </div>
                <ul class="pack-items-list">
                  <li><strong>Thermal Base Layers:</strong> Merino wool or synthetic long underwear for chilly mountain evenings (temperatures drop near 0°C / 32°F).</li>
                  <li><strong>Warm Fleece / Down Jacket:</strong> Essential for Simien campsites, Lalibela evenings, and Bale Sanetti plateau.</li>
                  <li><strong>Sturdy Hiking Boots:</strong> Broken-in ankle-support boots with merino wool socks for rocky escarpments.</li>
                  <li><strong>Slip-on Shoes / Sandals:</strong> Highly practical when frequently removing shoes before entering Lalibela and Lake Tana rock churches.</li>
                  <li><strong>Sun Protection:</strong> Wide-brimmed hat, polarized UV sunglasses, and high-SPF sunblock (high altitude intensifies UV rays).</li>
                </ul>
              </div>

              <!-- B. Danakil Depression Expedition -->
              <div class="pack-region-box">
                <div class="pack-region-header">
                  <h3>B. Danakil Depression Expedition (Extreme Heat & Volcanic Terrain)</h3>
                </div>
                <ul class="pack-items-list">
                  <li><strong>Ultra-Lightweight Clothing:</strong> Breathable, loose long-sleeve shirts and light trekking pants for sun and dust protection.</li>
                  <li><strong>Trail Shoes with Thick Soles:</strong> Sharp volcanic basalt rock around Erta Ale and Dallol can pierce thin soles.</li>
                  <li><strong>Headlamp with Extra Batteries:</strong> Absolutely essential for navigating the active crater rim of Erta Ale at night.</li>
                  <li><strong>Bandana, Buff or Neck Gaiter:</strong> Essential to shield nose and mouth from blowing desert sand and sulfur fumes at Dallol.</li>
                  <li><strong>Swimwear:</strong> For floating weightlessly in the emerald, hyper-saline waters of Lake Afrera.</li>
                  <li><strong>High-Capacity Power Banks:</strong> Electricity is unavailable during desert camping at Erta Ale and HamedEla.</li>
                </ul>
              </div>

              <!-- C. South Omo Valley Cultural Safari -->
              <div class="pack-region-box">
                <div class="pack-region-header">
                  <h3>C. South Omo Valley Cultural Safari (Warm & Dust Protection)</h3>
                </div>
                <ul class="pack-items-list">
                  <li><strong>Neutral Toned Attire:</strong> Lightweight cotton or linen shirts and trousers in neutral earth tones (khaki, olive, tan).</li>
                  <li><strong>Dust-Proof Dry Bags:</strong> Protect DSLR cameras, lenses, and sensitive electronics from fine red laterite dust on unpaved roads.</li>
                  <li><strong>Durable Walking Shoes:</strong> Comfortable sports shoes or sturdy sandals for walking through traditional village settlements.</li>
                  <li><strong>Compact Flashlight / Headlamp:</strong> Useful for evening power shutdowns at remote southern eco-lodges.</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- 3. Guidelines & Etiquette -->
          <div class="card-white guide-block">
            <span class="section-label">ETHICAL CODES</span>
            <h2>3. GUIDELINES & ETHICAL ETIQUETTE</h2>

            <div class="etiquette-grid">
              <div class="eti-card">
                <h4>Drone Regulations</h4>
                <p>
                  <strong>Strict Warning:</strong> Unmanned Aerial Vehicles (drones) are strictly regulated in Ethiopia. Operating a drone requires prior formal clearance from the Ethiopian Civil Aviation Authority and security agencies. Unsanctioned drones will be confiscated by customs upon arrival at Bole Airport.
                </p>
              </div>

              <div class="eti-card">
                <h4>Omo Valley Photography</h4>
                <p>
                  Always coordinate with your Abyssinian lead guide before taking portraits in tribal communities. In certain Omo Valley villages, cultural photo compensation fees are negotiated respectfully upfront by our team to protect local community dignity.
                </p>
              </div>

              <div class="eti-card">
                <h4>Cultural Sensitivity</h4>
                <p>
                  Always ask for permission before photographing individuals, religious ceremonies, or Orthodox clergy. Photography of military installations, police checkpoints, government administrative buildings, and strategic bridges is strictly prohibited by federal law.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- 4. Flight & Vehicle Information (Matching Screenshot 2) -->
          <div class="card-sand guide-block">
            <span class="section-label">LOGISTICAL INFRASTRUCTURE</span>
            <h2>4. FLIGHT & VEHICLE INFORMATION</h2>

            <div class="logistics-preview-grid">
              <div class="log-card">
                <div class="log-media">
                  <img src="/images/guide/ethiopian-airlines-flight.jpg" alt="Ethiopian Airlines Regional Flight" width="400" height="200" class="log-img" />
                </div>
                <div class="log-info">
                  <h4>Photo A. Domestic Flight Experience</h4>
                  <p>Standardized regional aircraft operated by Ethiopian Airlines. Domestic baggage limit is 20 kg (44 lbs) checked luggage plus 7 kg carry-on.</p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="log-card">
                <div class="log-media">
                  <img src="/images/about/fleet-4x4-landcruiser.jpg" alt="Private 4x4 Transport Fleet" width="400" height="200" class="log-img" />
                </div>
                <div class="log-info">
                  <h4>Photo B. Private 4x4 Transport Fleet</h4>
                  <p>Heavy-duty Toyota Land Cruiser 76 / 79 Series & Prado 4WDs. Equipped with dual A/C, seatbelts, satellite phone, first-aid equipment, and chilled mineral water.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Sidebar: Cultural Etiquette, Tipping & Emergency Dispatch (Matching Screenshot 2) -->
        <aside class="guide-sidebar">
          <!-- 5 & 6. Cultural Etiquette & Tipping Guidance -->
          <div class="card-white sidebar-card">
            <span class="section-label">LOCAL CUSTOMS</span>
            <h3 class="side-title">6. Cultural Etiquette & Tipping Guidance</h3>

            <div class="customs-box">
              <div class="custom-item">
                <strong>Church Entry Rules:</strong>
                <p>Remove shoes before entering church premises; step over the stone threshold with your right foot first. Cover shoulders and knees. Women may be offered a clean white cotton headscarf (Netela).</p>
              </div>

              <div class="custom-item">
                <strong>Greeting & Respect:</strong>
                <p>A polite nod with hands lightly clasped together, or a gentle right-handed handshake, is customary. Always use your right hand when giving or receiving food or items.</p>
              </div>

              <div class="custom-item">
                <strong>Tipping Benchmarks (Discretionary):</strong>
                <ul class="tipping-list">
                  <li><strong>Lead Tour Guide:</strong> $15 – $25 USD / group / day</li>
                  <li><strong>Professional 4x4 Driver:</strong> $10 – $15 USD / group / day</li>
                  <li><strong>Wilderness Camp Chef / Scout:</strong> $5 – $10 USD / day</li>
                  <li><strong>Hotel Porters:</strong> 100 – 200 ETB per service</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- 7. Emergency Contacts & Direct Field Dispatch (Matching Screenshot 2) -->
          <div class="card-sand sidebar-card emergency-box">
            <span class="section-label">24/7 SUPPORT</span>
            <h3 class="side-title">7. Emergency Contacts & Direct Field Dispatch</h3>
            <p class="emergency-sub">Keep these contacts saved on your phone and printed with your travel documents:</p>

            <div class="emergency-details">
              <p><strong>Abyssinian Headquarters:</strong> Addis Ababa Dispatch Desk</p>
              <p><strong>CEO & Lead Logistician:</strong> {siteConfig.founder.name}</p>
              <p><strong>Direct Mobile / WhatsApp:</strong> <a href={siteConfig.contact.whatsappUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="link-gold">{siteConfig.contact.phoneDisplay}</a></p>
              <p><strong>24/7 Operations Email:</strong> <a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.contact.emails.b2b}`}>{siteConfig.contact.emails.b2b}</a></p>
              <p><strong>Official Website:</strong> www.abyssiniatouroperator.com</p>
            </div>

            <div class="emergency-action">
              <a href={siteConfig.contact.whatsappUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-green btn-block" style="width: 100%;">
                WhatsApp Field Support
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Download Action Banner -->
          <div class="card-white sidebar-card text-center">
            <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-gold-deep)" stroke-width="2" style="margin: 0 auto 0.5rem auto;"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"></path><polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"></polyline><line x1="12" y1="15" x2="12" y2="3"></line></svg>
            <h4 style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Printable PDF Field Guide</h4>
            <p style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); margin-bottom: 1rem;">Have all packing checklists and emergency numbers handy on your phone or printed.</p>
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-gold btn-sm" onclick="window.print();" style="width: 100%;">
              [ Review and Download Your Custom Guide ]
            </button>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Trust Bar -->
  <TrustBar />
</MainLayout>

<style>
  .guide-main-col {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2.25rem;
  }

  .guide-block {
    padding: 2.25rem;
  }

  .guide-block h2 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--color-primary-dark);
  }

  .guide-lead {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--color-text-main);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  /* Checklist Grid */
  .checklist-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .check-card {
    background-color: #FFFFFF;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-sand-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    padding: 1.25rem;
  }

  .check-icon {
    width: 38px;
    height: 38px;
    background-color: var(--color-sand-card);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: var(--color-gold-deep);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .check-card h4 {
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
    color: var(--color-primary-dark);
  }

  .check-card p {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  /* Packing Accordion Boxes */
  .packing-accordion {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .pack-region-box {
    background-color: #FFFFFF;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-sand-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    padding: 1.5rem;
  }

  .pack-region-header h3 {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--color-primary-dark);
    margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
    padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-sand-border);
  }

  .pack-items-list {
    list-style: disc;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .pack-items-list strong {
    color: var(--color-primary-dark);
  }

  /* Etiquette Grid */
  .etiquette-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .eti-card {
    background-color: var(--color-sand-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-sand-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    padding: 1.25rem;
  }

  .eti-card h4 {
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
    color: var(--color-primary-dark);
  }

  .eti-card p {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  /* Flight & Vehicle Preview Grid */
  .logistics-preview-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .log-card {
    background-color: #FFFFFF;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-sand-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .log-media {
    height: 180px;
    background-color: #2F2720;
  }

  .log-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .log-info {
    padding: 1.25rem;
  }

  .log-info h4 {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
    color: var(--color-primary-dark);
  }

  .log-info p {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  /* Sidebar */
  .guide-sidebar {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .sidebar-card {
    padding: 1.5rem;
  }

  .side-title {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    margin: 0.35rem 0 1rem 0;
    color: var(--color-primary-dark);
  }

  .customs-box {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }

  .custom-item strong {
    display: block;
    color: var(--color-primary-dark);
    margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
  }

  .custom-item p {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  .tipping-list {
    list-style: disc;
    padding-left: 1.1rem;
    margin-top: 0.35rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.25rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .emergency-box {
    border-left: 4px solid var(--color-gold);
  }

  .emergency-sub {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .emergency-details {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--color-text-main);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .link-gold {
    color: var(--color-gold-deep);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .text-center {
    text-align: center;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .checklist-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .logistics-preview-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>

